	measure par30RateAmountNotFilters = ```
			
			DIVIDE(
			    CALCULATE(
			        SUM(vintage_analysis[PAR30]),
			        REMOVEFILTERS(vintage_analysis[enrollment_cohort])
			    ),
			    CALCULATE(
			        SUM(vintage_analysis[deployedCapital]),
			        REMOVEFILTERS(vintage_analysis[enrollment_cohort])
			    )
			)
			
			```
		lineageTag: 6a9cc0d5-2baf-4f4a-a2f1-f8a9fcbd7232

